Project Title: Two-Wheeled Self-Balanced Robot with Arduino

Field of Study: Electrical Engineering, Electronics, Robotics, and Embedded Systems

Main Controller: Arduino Uno

Programming Language: C++ using the Arduino framework

Control Technique: Proportional–Integral–Derivative (PID) Control

Motion Sensor: MPU6050 Accelerometer and Gyroscope

Motor Driver: L298N Dual H-Bridge (reference configuration)
